uppercase tracking-wider border border-gold/20 hover:border-gold rounded-none transition-all duration-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-gold/10\">Support Kabaddi<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"flex lg:hidden\"><button class=\"text-white hover:text-gold p-1.5 focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><section id=\"home\" class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-charcoal\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"P.G. Brothers Kabaddi Team\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.25] saturate-[0.8] contrast-[1.05]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0a0a]/70 via-[#0a0a0a]/90 to-charcoal\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,transparent_20%,#0a0a0a_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.01)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:40px_40px] pointer-events-none\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-24 pb-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20px)\"><div class=\"h-[1px] w-8 bg-gold\"></div><span class=\"text-gold font-oswald text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em]\">P.G. BROTHERS ORGANIZATION</span><div class=\"h-[1px] w-8 bg-gold\"></div></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight uppercase leading-none max-w-5xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\">Supporting the Players <br/><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">Who Keep Kabaddi Moving.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-8 text-gray-300 text-lg sm:text-xl font-light max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0\">PGBrothers.org is committed to supporting Kabaddi players, teams and grassroots sporting communities by creating encouragement, opportunities and a stronger platform for the game.</p><div class=\"mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"#about\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-forest-medium hover:bg-gold text-white hover:text-charcoal text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-gold/25 hover:border-gold rounded-none transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-gold/10 text-center\">Our Mission</a><a href=\"#support\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/5 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-white/20 hover:border-white rounded-none transition-all duration-300 text-center\">Support Kabaddi</a></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Scroll to explore</span><div class=\"w-5 h-9 border border-gray-600 rounded-full p-1 flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1.5 bg-gold rounded-full\"></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"statement\" class=\"relative py-20 bg-charcoal border-y border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-96 h-96 bg-forest-dark/10 rounded-full filter blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">THE SOUL OF THE GAME</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-oswald font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-6\">Kabaddi is more than a game.</h2><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mx-auto mb-8\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Kabaddi is built on courage, discipline, teamwork and relentless determination. Behind every raid, every tackle and every victory is a player who has invested time, effort and belief into the game.</p><p class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-widest\">PGBrothers.org exists to support that journey.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[2px] h-32 bg-gold/30\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl text-left\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">About Us</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">Our Purpose</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 \"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">We stand behind the athletes who give their all to the ground.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed\"><p><strong class=\"text-white font-semibold\">PGBrothers.org</strong> is focused on strengthening the Kabaddi community by supporting players, encouraging teams and creating greater opportunities for athletes to participate, compete and progress.</p><p>We believe talented players should have the encouragement and support needed to continue their sporting journey. From grassroots grounds to competitive tournaments, our goal is to help create an environment where dedication can turn into opportunity.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold bg-charcoal-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-left\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Trustworthy</h4><p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Authentic Support</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold bg-charcoal-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"text-left\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Community</h4><p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Grassroots Focus</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative\"><div class=\"relative aspect-square w-full max-w-md mx-auto border border-white/5 p-4 bg-charcoal\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-gold/15 scale-[0.98] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Supporting grassroots Kabaddi\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover filter contrast-[1.05] brightness-90 saturate-[0.9]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 p-4 bg-forest-medium border border-gold/20 text-center z-10 hidden sm:block\"><span class=\"block text-3xl font-oswald font-black text-gold\">100%</span><span class=\"block text-[8px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest\">Player Focused</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"support\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal relative\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,rgba(6,78,59,0.1),transparent_50%)] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Areas of Focus</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">What We Support</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Our support is structured across six key pillars to address the specific needs of athletes and teams.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Player Support</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Helping Kabaddi players receive encouragement and support as they continue developing their sporting journey.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Team Development</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Supporting team participation, teamwork and a stronger competitive environment for Kabaddi players.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Grassroots Kabaddi</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Encouraging Kabaddi at the grassroots level and helping young and emerging players stay connected to the sport.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M14 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17.916 10H19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 22 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-3\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M6.084 10H4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Tournament Participation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Supporting players and teams as they participate in local and competitive Kabaddi tournaments.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">05</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Talent Encouragement</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Recognizing dedication, performance and commitment so that promising players are encouraged to continue pursuing the game.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden h-full border-t-[3px] border-t-transparent hover:border-t-gold\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out pointer-events-none\"></div><div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 rounded-none text-gold group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-4xl font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold/30 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-300\">06</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Sporting Opportunities</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Working toward opportunities that can help players gain exposure, experience and confidence through Kabaddi.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 gap-1 uppercase tracking-widest\">Support details <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light border-y border-white/5 relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Core Attributes</span><h3 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase leading-none tracking-tight mb-6\">The Game Builds <br/><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">More Than Players.</span></h3><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mb-8\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Kabaddi develops qualities that extend far beyond the playing surface. It instills values that shape character, resilience, and communities.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-charcoal border-l-4 border-gold border-y border-r border-white/5 mt-6 lg:mt-0\"><p class=\"text-white font-oswald font-semibold text-base uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Our Core Belief</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">&quot;When we support Kabaddi, we support the people and communities built around it.&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Courage</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">Every raid demands confidence, quick decisions, and the bravery to face the opponent&#x27;s territory.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Discipline</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">Every match rewards thorough preparation, consistent fitness routines, and tactical compliance.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Teamwork</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">Every single point depends on collective effort, instant synchronization, and unwavering defense support.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Resilience</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">Every setback, failed raid, or lost match creates another opportunity to learn, improve, and fight back.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Fitness</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">The high-intensity game demands peak physical strength, explosive speed, agility, and lung capacity.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/10 bg-charcoal/30 flex gap-4 items-start group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-extrabold text-lg mt-0.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">/</div><div><h4 class=\"text-base font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Character</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light\">Rigorous competition teaches players how to win with humility and respond to challenges with determination.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"journey\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Progression Path</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">From the Ground to Greater Opportunities</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">The developmental path of a Kabaddi player requires consistent growth, structured effort, and support at every stage.</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 md:mt-24 relative\"><div class=\"absolute top-[40px] left-4 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[2px] h-[calc(100%-80px)] md:w-[calc(100%-120px)] md:h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r md:from-gold/10 md:via-gold/50 md:to-gold/10 bg-gold/30 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-8 md:gap-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">01</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Discover</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">A player discovers Kabaddi on local grounds and develops an initial passion for the sport.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">02</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Train</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">Rigorous daily practice, physical fitness, discipline, and consistency begin shaping the athlete.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">03</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Compete</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">Entering local matches and tournaments to gain vital experience under pressure.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">04</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Develop</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">Real-game experience creates stronger tactical skills, confidence, and deeper understanding.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">05</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Represent</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">Earning opportunities to represent established teams and compete at higher tournament levels.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-start text-left md:text-center px-4 group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 md:w-16 md:h-16 rounded-full bg-charcoal border-2 border-gold flex items-center justify-center z-10 mx-auto group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors duration-300 shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-oswald font-extrabold text-gold group-hover:text-charcoal transition-colors\">06</span></div><div class=\"ml-6 md:ml-0 md:mt-6 text-left md:text-center flex-grow\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Inspire</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto font-light\">Successful athlete journeys motivate and inspire the next generation to step onto the Kabaddi ground.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative py-32 md:py-48 bg-charcoal overflow-hidden border-y border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"Kabaddi team spirit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.2] saturate-[0.7]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal via-charcoal/85 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl text-left\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Collective Strength</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-oswald font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mb-6\">No Player Stands Alone.</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gold w-24 mb-8\"></div><div class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed\"><p>Kabaddi is a team sport built entirely on trust. Every defender depends on another player&#x27;s backup. Every raid creates collective responsibility. Every single victory belongs to the team.</p><p>PGBrothers.org believes that supporting the game means supporting the entire sporting community — players, teams, coaches, families, organizers and the young athletes watching from the sidelines.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"moments\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl text-left\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Moments that Matter</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">Dedication in Action</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 \"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Every tournament creates a story. Every trophy represents effort. Every team photograph captures a journey.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12\"><div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] w-full border border-white/5 cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Championship Team Group\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 filter brightness-[0.75] contrast-[1.05] group-hover:brightness-[0.85]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal via-charcoal/30 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] bg-gold scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 origin-left\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 opacity-95\">T