xt/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal via-charcoal/30 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] bg-gold scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 origin-left\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 opacity-95\">COMPETITION • COMMITMENT</span><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide leading-tight group-hover:text-gold transition-colors\">Evening Tournament Stand</h4><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-xs mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 font-light max-w-md opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 transform translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-y-0\">A team lined up under field lights, ready to coordinate, defend, and compete.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-charcoal overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(212,175,55,0.05),transparent_60%)] animate-pulse-slow pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/5] w-full overflow-hidden border border-gold/10 group\"><img alt=\"Kabaddi Championship Gold Trophy\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center filter grayscale contrast-[1.1] brightness-[0.8] group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-20 animate-shine pointer-events-none\"></div></div><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/5] w-full overflow-hidden border border-gold/10 group mt-8\"><img alt=\"Winner Trophy Display\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center filter grayscale contrast-[1.1] brightness-[0.8] group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-20 animate-shine pointer-events-none\"></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Reward of Sweat</span><h3 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mb-6\">Every Trophy <br/><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">Has a Story.</span></h3><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mb-8\"></div><div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed\"><p>A trophy is more than an object of metal or wood. It represents the practices nobody saw, the early mornings, the demanding training matches that tested the team, and the players who stayed committed.</p><p>It stands for the people who stood behind the team—organizers, families, supporters, and fellow athletes.</p><p class=\"text-white font-oswald font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-base mt-8 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>We celebrate the effort behind every achievement.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"stories\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Talent Showcase</span><h3 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight leading-none\">The People Behind the Game</h3><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mt-4 mb-5\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-base font-light\">Every Kabaddi player has a story of early mornings, demanding practice sessions, tough matches, setbacks, comebacks, and the determination to keep playing.</p></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs italic mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-xs md:text-right border-l-2 md:border-l-0 md:border-r-2 border-gold/25 pl-4 md:pl-0 pr-0 md:pr-4\">PGBrothers.org aims to give these journeys greater visibility, encouragement, and platform exposure.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"glass-card relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 rounded-none flex flex-col h-full bg-[#161616]/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal-medium to-charcoal flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_80%_at_50%_-20%,rgba(6,78,59,0.25),rgba(255,255,255,0))]\"></div><div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold/30 bg-charcoal/50 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-gold/50 group-hover:text-gold transition-all duration-500 z-10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user w-10 h-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 py-2 px-3 bg-charcoal/90 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gold/20 text-center z-20\"><p class=\"text-xs font-oswald font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-pulse text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg>Profile Coming Soon</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2 block\">Athlete Profile <!-- -->1</span><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-semibold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4\">Under Evaluation</h4><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-gray-400\"><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Position</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">Raider</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Team</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">To Be Announced</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Focus</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-semibold\">Grassroots Development</span></div></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs italic mt-6 border-l-2 border-gold/20 pl-3\">&quot;Dedication in training prepares athletes for opportunities. Detailed journeys and performance statistics will be updated here.&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"glass-card relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 rounded-none flex flex-col h-full bg-[#161616]/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal-medium to-charcoal flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_80%_at_50%_-20%,rgba(6,78,59,0.25),rgba(255,255,255,0))]\"></div><div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold/30 bg-charcoal/50 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-gold/50 group-hover:text-gold transition-all duration-500 z-10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user w-10 h-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 py-2 px-3 bg-charcoal/90 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gold/20 text-center z-20\"><p class=\"text-xs font-oswald font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-pulse text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg>Profile Coming Soon</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2 block\">Athlete Profile <!-- -->2</span><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-semibold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4\">Under Evaluation</h4><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-gray-400\"><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Position</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">Right Corner Defender</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Team</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">To Be Announced</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Focus</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-semibold\">Local Tournaments</span></div></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs italic mt-6 border-l-2 border-gold/20 pl-3\">&quot;Dedication in training prepares athletes for opportunities. Detailed journeys and performance statistics will be updated here.&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"glass-card relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 rounded-none flex flex-col h-full bg-[#161616]/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal-medium to-charcoal flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_80%_at_50%_-20%,rgba(6,78,59,0.25),rgba(255,255,255,0))]\"></div><div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold/30 bg-charcoal/50 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:border-gold/50 group-hover:text-gold transition-all duration-500 z-10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user w-10 h-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 py-2 px-3 bg-charcoal/90 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gold/20 text-center z-20\"><p class=\"text-xs font-oswald font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-pulse text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg>Profile Coming Soon</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2 block\">Athlete Profile <!-- -->3</span><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-semibold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4\">Under Evaluation</h4><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-gray-400\"><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Position</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">All-Rounder</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Team</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\">To Be Announced</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Focus</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-semibold\">Junior Division</span></div></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs italic mt-6 border-l-2 border-gold/20 pl-3\">&quot;Dedication in training prepares athletes for opportunities. Detailed journeys and performance statistics will be updated here.&quot;</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal relative border-t border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Social Impact</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">Building a Stronger Kabaddi Community</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Kabaddi grows when players, teams and communities grow together. We want to encourage a sporting culture where young players can discover the game, experienced players can contribute, and teams find support.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-[#161616]/30 text-center flex flex-col items-center hover:border-gold/20 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-forest-medium/10 text-gold border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3\">Players</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Encourage and support athletes by providing platforms, resources, and recognition to fuel their athletic careers.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-[#161616]/30 text-center flex flex-col items-center hover:border-gold/20 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-forest-medium/10 text-gold border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3\">Teams</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Strengthen participation, coordination, and teamwork by supporting squad tournament entries and matches.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-[#161616]/30 text-center flex flex-col items-center hover:border-gold/20 transition-colors\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-forest-medium/10 text-gold border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3\">Community</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Keep Kabaddi growing at the grassroots level, making the sport accessible to younger demographics.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"support-cta\" class=\"relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-charcoal border-y border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-15\"><img alt=\"Kabaddi background\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0a0a] via-charcoal/95 to-[#0a0a0a] z-0\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Contribute to the Movement</span><h3 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-6\">Help Us Support Kabaddi.</h3><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mx-auto mb-8\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Your support can help create more opportunities for players, teams and grassroots Kabaddi communities. We focus on direct sporting support where it counts.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-300 border border-white/5 bg-[#121212]/50 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Player Support</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Team Support</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Tournament Entry</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Sporting Equipment</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Training Support</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Grassroots Initiatives</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Talent Development</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-gold\"></div> Kabaddi Events</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6\"><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-charcoal hover:bg-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300 text-center\">Support the Game</a><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/5 text-white border border-white/20 hover:border-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300 text-center\">Get Involved</a></div></div></section><section id=\"get-involved\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Collaborate</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">There&#x27;s a Place for Everyone in the Game.</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Whether you play, support, coordinate or represent, your contribution plays a vital role in our collective sports growth.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-12\"><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 bg-charcoal/40 flex flex-col justify-between h-full group hover:border-gold/20 transition-all\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block\">Category 0<!-- -->1</span><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Player</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Want to take your Kabaddi journey forward?</p></div><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"flex items-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white group-hover:text-gold transition-colors gap-1.5 focus:outline-none\">Join the Community<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 bg-charcoal/40 flex flex-col justify-between h-full group hover:border-gold/20 transition-all\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block\">Category 0<!-- -->2</span><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Team</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Looking for support or collaboration?</p></div><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"flex items-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white group-hover:text-gold transition-colors gap-1.5 focus:outline-none\">Connect with us<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 bg-charcoal/40 flex flex-col justify-between h-full group hover:border-gold/20 transition-all\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block\">Category 0<!-- -->3</span><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Supporter</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Want to contribute to Kabaddi development?</p></div><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"flex items-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white group-hover:text-gold transition-colors gap-1.5 focus:outline-none\">Support Kabaddi<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 border border-white/5 bg-charcoal/40 flex flex-col justify-between h-full group hover:border-gold/20 transition-all\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block\">Category 0<!-- -->4</span><h4 class=\"text-xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Organization</h4><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Interested in partnering with us?</p></div><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"flex items-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white group-hover:text-gold transition-colors gap-1.5 focus:outline-none\">Partner with us<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-charcoal relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Synergistic Network</span><h3 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-4\">Partnerships that Move the Game Forward</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8\">Supporting Kabaddi requires a strong sporting ecosystem. PGBrothers.org welcomes meaningful collaborations with individuals, teams, sporting organizations, businesses and supporters who believe in developing Kabaddi and creating better opportunities for players.</p><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-forest-medium hover:bg-gold text-white hover:text-charcoal border border-gold/15 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300\">Become a Partner</a></div></section><section id=\"gallery\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal-light relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Visual Archives</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">The Kabaddi Journey</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Real Players. Real Games. Real Effort. Real Stories. Explore visual representations of grassroots and tournament matches.</p></div><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-2 mb-10 md:mb-14\"><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-gold text-charcoal border border-gold\">ALL</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-charcoal border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/30 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">PLAYERS</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-charcoal border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/30 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">TEAMS</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-charcoal border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/30 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">TOURNAMENTS</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-charcoal border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/30 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">TROPHIES</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-charcoal border border-white/5 hover:border-gold/30 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">COMMUNITY</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 cursor-pointer aspect-video md:aspect-square md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.9)\"><img alt=\"TEAM • TOGETHER\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-90 group-hover:brightness-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, (max-w-1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\"><div><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TEAMS</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TOURNAMENTS</span></div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide\">TEAM • TOGETHER</h4><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-xs mt-1 line-clamp-2 max-w-sm font-light\">A group of players and organizers sharing a moment of unity during a tournament.</p></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 text-gold rounded-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 cursor-pointer aspect-video md:aspect-square \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.9)\"><img alt=\"VICTORY • CELEBRATION\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-90 group-hover:brightness-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, (max-w-1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?