d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 cursor-pointer aspect-video md:aspect-square \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.9)\"><img alt=\"THE JOURNEY • CONTINUES\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-90 group-hover:brightness-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, (max-w-1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fgrassroots_support.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\"><div><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">COMMUNITY</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">PLAYERS</span></div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide\">THE JOURNEY • CONTINUES</h4><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-xs mt-1 line-clamp-2 max-w-sm font-light\">Encouraging a young athlete with sporting gear to support his training and progression.</p></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 text-gold rounded-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 cursor-pointer aspect-video md:aspect-square \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.9)\"><img alt=\"VICTORY • CELEBRATION\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-90 group-hover:brightness-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, (max-w-1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ftrophy_player_11.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\"><div><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">PLAYERS</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TROPHIES</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TOURNAMENTS</span></div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide\">VICTORY • CELEBRATION</h4><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-xs mt-1 line-clamp-2 max-w-sm font-light\">A player proudly celebrating a tournament victory with the championship trophy.</p></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 text-gold rounded-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden group border border-white/5 cursor-pointer aspect-video md:aspect-square md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.9)\"><img alt=\"COMPETITION • COMMITMENT\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-90 group-hover:brightness-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, (max-w-1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam_photo_2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\"><div><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TEAMS</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">TOURNAMENTS</span><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest text-gold bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-none\">COMMUNITY</span></div><h4 class=\"text-lg font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide\">COMPETITION • COMMITMENT</h4><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-xs mt-1 line-clamp-2 max-w-sm font-light\">A team posing together under tournament lighting, showcasing collective unity.</p></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 text-gold rounded-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal relative overflow-hidden border-y border-white/5\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gold/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-4 block\">Qualitative Value</span><h3 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-black text-white uppercase leading-none tracking-tight mb-8\">Our Impact Starts <br/><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">With One Player.</span></h3><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gold w-16 mx-auto mb-10\"></div><div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><p>A player who receives encouragement can continue.</p><p>A team that receives support can compete.</p><p>A young athlete who sees an opportunity can believe.</p><p>And a community that believes in its players can help Kabaddi grow.</p><p class=\"text-gold font-oswald font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-wider mt-8\">That is the impact we want to create.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-charcoal-light text-center relative\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase mb-3 block\">Forward Outlook</span><h3 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-oswald font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-6\">The Next Generation is Waiting.</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-base font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">Our vision is to contribute to a stronger Kabaddi ecosystem where talented players have greater encouragement, teams have better opportunities to participate, and young athletes can see a future in the sport they love.</p><p class=\"text-white font-oswald font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-base\">Today we support the game. Tomorrow we want to help shape its future.</p></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-charcoal relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-stretch\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between py-2\"><div><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-3xl text-left\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-3 px-3 py-1 bg-forest-medium/30 border border-gold/10 rounded-full\">Connect</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-oswald font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none\">Let&#x27;s Talk Kabaddi.</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-gold via-forest-medium to-transparent w-24 mt-4 mb-5 \"></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed\">Whether you are a player, team, supporter, organization or potential partner, we would love to hear from you.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-400 text-sm font-light mt-8\"><p>Are you an athlete needing training support or shoe equipment? Are you a captain/coach representing a local Kabaddi squad looking to participate in upcoming competitive games? Or a community supporter looking to co-sponsor grassroots events?</p><p>Fill out the form and submit your request. We will review your message and reply as soon as possible.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 p-4 bg-forest-medium/10 border border-gold/15 text-xs text-gold/80 leading-relaxed font-light\"><strong>Important Notice:</strong> PGBrothers.org works directly with sporting initiatives. All submissions are evaluated individually. We are dedicated to providing support directly to players and grassroots structures.</div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"glass-card p-6 sm:p-10 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden bg-charcoal-light/40\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-shimmer opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div><form class=\"space-y-6\" noValidate=\"\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><label for=\"fullName\" class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2\">Full Name <span class=\"text-gold\">*</span></label><input type=\"text\" id=\"fullName\" placeholder=\"e.g. Rahul Kumar\" class=\"px-4 py-3 bg-charcoal border text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors border-white/10\" name=\"fullName\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><label for=\"email\" class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2\">Email Address <span class=\"text-gold\">*</span></label><input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"e.g. rahul@example.com\" class=\"px-4 py-3 bg-charcoal border text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors border-white/10\" name=\"email\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><label for=\"phone\" class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2\">Phone Number <span class=\"text-gold\">*</span></label><input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" placeholder=\"e.g. +91 9876543210\" class=\"px-4 py-3 bg-charcoal border text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors border-white/10\" name=\"phone\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><label for=\"role\" class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2\">I am a: <span class=\"text-gold\">*</span></label><div class=\"relative\"><select id=\"role\" name=\"role\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-charcoal border text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors appearance-none cursor-pointer border-white/10\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Select your category</option><option value=\"Player\">Player</option><option value=\"Team\">Team</option><option value=\"Coach\">Coach</option><option value=\"Supporter\">Supporter</option><option value=\"Organization\">Organization</option><option value=\"Partner\">Partner</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select><div class=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none text-gray-500\">▼</div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><label for=\"message\" class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2\">Message <span class=\"text-gold\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your Kabaddi journey, your team, or how you want to support...\" class=\"px-4 py-3 bg-charcoal border text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors border-white/10\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full py-4 bg-forest-medium hover:bg-gold text-white hover:text-charcoal font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-gold/20 hover:border-gold rounded-none transition-all duration-300 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg>Send Message</button></form></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-[#050505] border-t border-white/5 pt-16 pb-8 text-gray-400 text-sm\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/5\"><div class=\"md:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-3xl font-oswald font-black tracking-wider text-white\">P.G. <span class=\"text-gold\">BROTHERS</span></span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">Supporting Players. Building Teams. Growing Kabaddi. Dedicated to grassroots development, talent encouragement, and sporting opportunities.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 md:mt-0 text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\">Official Website: <span class=\"text-white\">PGBrothers.org</span></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h5 class=\"text-white font-oswald font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-4\">Organization</h5><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\"><li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"#about\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">About Us</a></li><li><a href=\"#support\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">What We Support</a></li><li><a href=\"#get-involved\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">Get Involved</a></li></ul></div><div><h5 class=\"text-white font-oswald font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-4\">Kabaddi</h5><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\"><li><a href=\"#stories\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">Player Stories</a></li><li><a href=\"#moments\" class=\"hover:text-gold transition-colors duration-200\">Moments</a></li><li><a href=\"#gallery\" cl